  "notes": "Update notifications are now reliable. The app reads every download mirror and takes the newest answer, instead of stopping at the first one that replied - a mirror that was reachable but a few minutes out of date could previously make a brand-new version look as though it did not exist, with nothing shown to say so. Also in this build: Activation is automatic (type your email, press Request Activation Key, and the key is emailed back), and saving as DWG says up front what it keeps exactly and what may look different before it writes. Only the changed parts are downloaded, so this update is about 1 MB.",
